### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ========================================
### STEP 1: LOGIN
### ========================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

###
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ========================================
### TEST 1: LIST ALL XML FILES
### ========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/xml/transactions/list
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### TEST 2: EXPORT ALL TRANSACTIONS TO SINGLE XML
### ========================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/xml/transactions/export-all
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
